{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "%@ %@ asked to pair.": {
      "comment": "配对窗口首行；插值为设备名和其他来源说明",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ %2$@ asked to pair."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ %@ 请求配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ %@ changed signature: expected %@, found %@": {
      "comment": "虚拟显示器设置：系统方法签名变化，插值为类、方法及签名",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ %2$@ changed signature: expected %3$@, found %4$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ %@ 的签名已更改：应为 %@，实际为 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ Connected": {
      "comment": "状态卡连接标题，插值为设备简称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ Devices Connected": {
      "comment": "状态卡连接标题，插值为设备数量",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 台设备已连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ Mbps": {
      "comment": "Mac 自定义画质名称，插值为码率",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ Mbps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ Wants to Pair": {
      "comment": "配对请求标题，插值为设备简称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 请求配对"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ and %@ need the USB cable or very fast Wi‑Fi; if the picture lags, step down.": {
      "comment": "Mac 串流设置说明，插值为两种高码率画质名称",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ and %2$@ need the USB cable or very fast Wi‑Fi; if the picture lags, step down."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 和 %@ 需要 USB 连接线或速度很快的 Wi‑Fi；如果画面卡顿，请降低画质。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ asked to pair.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 请求配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ can no longer connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 无法再连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ can no longer connect. To use it again, pair it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 无法再连接。如需再次使用，请重新配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ couldn’t be read: %@": {
      "comment": "设备设置钥匙串读取错误：插值为条目标识和系统错误说明",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ couldn’t be read: %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取 %@：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ couldn’t be saved: %@": {
      "comment": "设备设置钥匙串保存错误：插值为条目标识和系统错误说明",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ couldn’t be saved: %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法保存 %@：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ fps · frame age %@ · RTT %@": {
      "comment": "状态卡设备统计，插值为帧率、画面延迟和往返延迟",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ fps · frame age %2$@ · RTT %3$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ fps · 画面延迟 %@ · 往返延迟 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ fps, still": {
      "comment": "状态卡静止画面帧率，插值为帧率上限",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ fps，画面静止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ fps, the link can’t carry %@": {
      "comment": "状态卡连接跟不上，插值为帧率和画质",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ fps, the link can’t carry %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ fps，连接带宽不足以支持 %@ 画质"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ fps, the link can’t carry %@ · RTT %@": {
      "comment": "状态卡连接跟不上，插值为帧率、画质和往返延迟",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ fps, the link can’t carry %2$@ · RTT %3$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ fps，连接带宽不足以支持 %@ 画质 · 往返延迟 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ init returned nil": {
      "comment": "虚拟显示器设置：系统对象初始化失败，插值为类名",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 的 init 返回了 nil"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is locked": {
      "comment": "锁屏覆盖层标题，插值为 Mac 名称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已锁定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is locked. Unlock it to see its windows.": {
      "comment": "应用抽屉和设置中的锁屏提示，插值为 Mac 名称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已锁定。解锁后即可查看其窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is no longer open.": {
      "comment": "设备菜单：应用已关闭，插值为应用名称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is not among the apps ScreenCaptureKit lists": {
      "comment": "音频状态：系统未列出应用，插值为应用名称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ScreenCaptureKit 列出的应用中没有 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is paired with this Mac.": {
      "comment": "USB 自动配对通知首行；插值为设备名",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已与这台 Mac 配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is still paired: Sill couldn’t update the keychain (%@). Try again.": {
      "comment": "USB 配对通知移除失败；插值为设备名和钥匙串故障原因\n设备面板中移除配对失败的警告；插值为设备名和钥匙串故障原因",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ is still paired: Sill couldn’t update the keychain (%2$@). Try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 仍处于已配对状态：Sill 无法更新钥匙串（%@）。请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ isn’t responding.": {
      "comment": "设备菜单：应用未响应，插值为应用名称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 未响应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ ms": {
      "comment": "状态卡时间，插值为毫秒数",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ ms"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ nearby asked to pair.": {
      "comment": "配对窗口首行；插值为附近请求配对的设备名",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "附近的 %@ 请求配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ of %@ fps": {
      "comment": "状态卡帧率，插值为当前帧率和上限",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ of %2$@ fps"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ fps，上限 %2$@ fps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ on this Mac asked to pair.": {
      "comment": "配对窗口首行；插值为本机请求配对的设备名",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 上的 %@ 请求配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ on this network asked to pair.": {
      "comment": "配对窗口首行；插值为通过本地网络请求配对的设备名",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个网络上的 %@ 请求配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ times": {
      "comment": "Aa 文字大小的 VoiceOver 播报，插值为缩放倍数",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 倍"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · Retina": {
      "comment": "Mac 画质及分辨率摘要，插值为画质名称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · Retina"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · Standard": {
      "comment": "Mac 画质及分辨率摘要，插值为画质名称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · 标准"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ — %@ Mbps": {
      "comment": "Mac 画质菜单标题，插值为预设名称和码率",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ — %2$@ Mbps"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ — %@ Mbps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ — Not connected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ — 未连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@. Quit and reopen Sill to try again.": {
      "comment": "状态卡网络失败说明，插值为错误信息",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@。请退出并重新打开 Sill 以重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@×%@ · %@ · %@ Mbps": {
      "comment": "状态卡串流参数，插值为尺寸、帧率和码率",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@×%2$@ · %3$@ · %4$@ Mbps"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@×%@ · %@ · %@ Mbps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "120 fps": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "120 fps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "60 fps": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "60 fps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A code is showing.": {
      "comment": "配对请求提醒，验证码已显示",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在显示配对码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A device %@ asked to pair.": {
      "comment": "配对窗口首行；插值为未命名设备的其他来源说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一台设备 %@ 请求配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A device nearby asked to pair.": {
      "comment": "配对窗口首行；附近的未命名设备请求配对",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "附近的一台设备请求配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A device on this Mac asked to pair.": {
      "comment": "配对窗口首行；本机的未命名设备请求配对",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 上的一台设备请求配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A device on this network asked to pair.": {
      "comment": "配对窗口首行；未命名设备通过本地网络请求配对",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个网络上的一台设备请求配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A paired device can see and control this Mac on your network, nearby, and from afar while Remote Access is on. If one is lost, remove it here.": {
      "comment": "设备面板页脚中配对权限的说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已配对设备可通过你的网络或在附近查看和控制这台 Mac，远程访问开启时也可从远处访问。如果设备丢失，请在这里将它移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A paired device can see and control this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已配对设备可查看和控制这台 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A wrong code came from %@. %@ tries left.": {
      "comment": "配对码错误警告；插值为错误请求来源及剩余次数",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "A wrong code came from %1$@. %2$@ tries left."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 发送了错误的配对码。还可以再试 %@ 次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A wrong code came from %@. 1 try left.": {
      "comment": "配对码错误警告；插值为错误请求来源，仅剩一次机会",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 发送了错误的配对码。还可以再试 1 次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AAC-ELD's format failed (%@%@)": {
      "comment": "音频状态：编码器步骤失败，插值为系统状态码及其字符形式",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "AAC-ELD's format failed (%1$@%2$@)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AAC-ELD 的格式设置失败（%@%@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About Sill": {
      "comment": "主菜单：关于应用",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于 Sill"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Access belongs to Sill itself. Access you gave Terminal for the SillHost command-line tool doesn’t carry over.": {
      "comment": "权限设置页脚：授权仅属于当前 Sill 应用",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "权限属于 Sill 本身。你为 SillHost 命令行工具授予终端的权限不会同时授予 Sill。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accessibility": {
      "comment": "权限行标题：辅助功能",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "辅助功能"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accessibility: Allowed": {
      "comment": "状态菜单辅助功能已允许",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "辅助功能：已允许"
          }
        }
      }
