    "Another user started controlling this Mac.": {
      "comment": "用户切换覆盖层标题",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另一位用户开始控制这台 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another user started controlling this Mac. Log in to your account to reactivate screen sharing with Sill.": {
      "comment": "应用抽屉和设置中的用户切换提示",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另一位用户开始控制这台 Mac。请登录你的账户，以重新启用 Sill 屏幕共享。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any device on your network (or nearby, with Direct Wireless Connection on) and any app on this Mac can see and control it without pairing. Connections are still encrypted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你网络上的任何设备（开启无线直连时也包括附近设备）以及这台 Mac 上的任何应用，都可无需配对便查看和控制它。连接仍会加密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anyone on the internet can now reach port %@ and try to connect. Sill turns away every device you haven’t paired. Turning this off doesn’t close the port on your router: remove the forward there too.": {
      "comment": "远程访问面板中开放互联网连接的说明；插值为端口号",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "互联网上的任何人现在都可访问端口 %@ 并尝试连接。Sill 会拒绝所有未配对的设备。关闭此项不会关闭路由器上的端口：你还需要在路由器上移除端口转发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Approve Sill in System Settings › Login Items": {
      "comment": "状态菜单登录启动待批准说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在系统设置 › 登录项中批准 Sill"
