      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查找…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Firewall": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "防火墙"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forward TCP port %@ on your router to this Mac (%@), and reserve that address for this Mac in the router’s settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Forward TCP port %1$@ on your router to this Mac (%2$@), and reserve that address for this Mac in the router’s settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将路由器上的 TCP 端口 %@ 转发到这台 Mac（%@），并在路由器设置中为这台 Mac 保留该地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frame Rate": {
      "comment": "状态菜单帧率标题",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "帧率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frame rate limit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "帧率上限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "General": {
      "comment": "设置窗口：通用标签页",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hardware Encoder Busy": {
      "comment": "状态菜单硬件编码器忙碌提醒",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "硬件编码器繁忙"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hardware Encoder Stuck": {
      "comment": "状态菜单硬件编码器卡住提醒",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "硬件编码器无响应"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High": {
      "comment": "Mac 画质预设名称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IPv6": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "IPv6"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If your iPhone or iPad can’t find this Mac, allow Sill in Privacy & Security › Local Network.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果你的 iPhone 或 iPad 找不到这台 Mac，请在“隐私与安全性”›“本地网络”中允许 Sill 访问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If your router has a dynamic DNS name, enter it so your devices keep finding this Mac when your internet address changes. Add :port if the router forwards a different outside port.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果你的路由器有动态 DNS 域名，请输入该域名，这样互联网地址变化时，设备仍能找到这台 Mac。如果路由器转发的外部端口不同，请加上 :port。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Sill on your iPhone or iPad, tap this Mac, or tap Add a Mac… when you’re away, then point it at this code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 iPhone 或 iPad 上打开 Sill，轻点这台 Mac；外出时则轻点“添加 Mac…”，然后将设备对准此配对码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Internet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "互联网"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It isn’t available right now.": {
      "comment": "设备菜单：暂时不可用提示",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目前不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It paired by itself over the USB cable, and can connect over Wi‑Fi and nearby from now on too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它已通过 USB 线缆自动配对，今后也可以通过 Wi‑Fi 或在附近直连。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It tried to connect with an older Sill.": {
      "comment": "状态菜单旧版设备提醒说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它尝试使用旧版 Sill 连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its windows come back once it is unlocked.": {
      "comment": "未配对设备的锁屏覆盖层说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解锁后，它的窗口就会重新出现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last checked %@.": {
      "comment": "设置更新检查：插值为上次检查日期",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次检查时间：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last window": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次串流的窗口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Launch at Login": {
      "comment": "状态菜单登录启动标题",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录时打开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Launch at login": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录时打开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets Sill capture the windows you pick on your iPhone or iPad, and their sound when Send Audio is on. Nothing is recorded or saved; frames and sound go straight to your devices.": {
      "comment": "屏幕录制权限说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许 Sill 捕捉你在 iPhone 或 iPad 上选择的窗口，以及开启“发送声音”时这些窗口的声音。画面和声音会直接传送到你的设备，不会录制或保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets the iPhone and iPad you pair connect to this Mac from other networks: through a VPN such as Tailscale, or through a port you forward on your router. Sill turns away every device you haven’t paired, and encrypts everything the paired ones send and receive.": {
      "comment": "远程访问面板页脚中连接方式和加密的说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让已配对的 iPhone 和 iPad 从其他网络连接这台 Mac：可以通过 Tailscale 等 VPN，或通过路由器上转发的端口连接。Sill 会拒绝所有未配对的设备，并加密已配对设备收发的所有数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets your iPhone and iPad connect when they’re near this Mac, even without a shared Wi‑Fi network, the way AirDrop does. While it’s on, this Mac’s Wi‑Fi keeps stepping away from your network, so streaming over Wi‑Fi can stutter. Anyone nearby with Sill can find this Mac; only devices you paired can connect, unless Require pairing is off.": {
      "comment": "通用设置中直接无线连接的说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让你的 iPhone 和 iPad 在这台 Mac 附近时，无需连接同一 Wi‑Fi 网络也能连接，原理与 AirDrop 相同。开启后，这台 Mac 的 Wi‑Fi 会不断短暂离开当前网络，因此通过 Wi‑Fi 串流时可能会卡顿。附近任何使用 Sill 的人都能找到这台 Mac；除非关闭“需要配对”，否则只有已配对的设备才能连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets your iPhone or iPad click, scroll and type on this Mac, and lets Sill move and size the window it streams.": {
      "comment": "辅助功能权限说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让你的 iPhone 或 iPad 在这台 Mac 上点按、滚动和输入文字，并允许 Sill 移动和调整正在串流的窗口大小。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local Network": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本地网络"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Locked": {
      "comment": "状态菜单：Mac 已锁定",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已锁定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Log in to your account to reactivate screen sharing with Sill.": {
      "comment": "用户切换覆盖层的登录说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录你的账户，以重新启用 Sill 屏幕共享。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Low": {
      "comment": "Mac 画质预设名称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "低"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lower latency when the Mac is busy, at a softer picture.": {
      "comment": "串流设置中优先编码速度的说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
