      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要屏幕录制和辅助功能权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs attention": {
      "comment": "状态菜单警告图标的辅助功能说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要处理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New Code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新配对码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No VPN is running on this Mac. Install one such as Tailscale on this Mac and on your iPhone or iPad, or allow connections from the internet below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 上没有正在运行的 VPN。请在这台 Mac 和你的 iPhone 或 iPad 上安装 Tailscale 等 VPN，或在下方允许来自互联网的连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No paired devices yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚无已配对的设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No shared network needed; Wi‑Fi streams can stutter": {
      "comment": "状态菜单直接无线连接说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无需连接同一网络；Wi‑Fi 串流可能会卡顿"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "None": {
      "comment": "远程访问面板：尚无配对设备",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not Visible on the Network": {
      "comment": "状态卡标题，网络不可见",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在网络上不可见"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not advertised (test pattern mode)": {
      "comment": "通用设置中的网络状态：测试图案模式未广播",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未广播（测试图案模式）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not advertised; test clients connect to port %@.": {
      "comment": "状态卡测试图案说明，插值为端口号",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未广播；测试客户端请连接端口 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not available on this version of macOS: %@": {
      "comment": "虚拟显示设置中的不可用原因；插值为系统故障说明\n设备设置：系统不支持虚拟显示器，插值为错误说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此版本的 macOS 不支持：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not checked yet.": {
      "comment": "设置更新检查：尚未检查",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not visible (the listener failed)": {
      "comment": "通用设置中的网络状态：监听失败",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不可见（监听失败）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not yet (waiting for the network)": {
      "comment": "通用设置中的网络状态：等待网络",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂不可见（正在等待网络）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing is getting through": {
      "comment": "状态卡连接停滞说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有数据传输"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing you copy goes between this %@ and %@ while this is off.": {
      "comment": "设置中共享剪贴板关闭时的说明，插值为设备类型和 Mac 名称",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Nothing you copy goes between this %1$@ and %2$@ while this is off."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭后，你拷贝的任何内容都不会在这台 %@ 和 %@ 之间传输。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "好"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off": {
      "comment": "Aa 文字大小关闭时的 VoiceOver 播报\nAa 文字大小控件的关闭状态\n远程访问菜单副标题，当前已关闭",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off for this session: %@": {
      "comment": "虚拟显示设置中的停用状态；插值为停用原因",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次会话已停用：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off for this session: %@. Turn it off and on to try again.": {
      "comment": "设备设置：本次虚拟显示器已停用，插值为错误说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次会话已停用：%@。请关闭后重新开启以重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a Retina display, a quarter of the pixels to encode": {
      "comment": "状态菜单标准分辨率说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Retina 显示器上，只需编码四分之一的像素"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On · %@": {
      "comment": "远程访问菜单副标题，插值为 VPN 名称",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已开启 · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On · %@ and %@": {
      "comment": "远程访问菜单副标题，插值为前面的 VPN 名称列表和最后一个名称",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "On · %1$@ and %2$@"
          }
        },
