      }
    },
    "The macOS firewall blocks Sill’s executable, so devices on the network cannot connect. In Terminal:": {
      "comment": "通用设置：防火墙阻止可执行文件",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 防火墙阻止了 Sill 的可执行文件，因此网络上的设备无法连接。请在终端中执行："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The macOS firewall blocks Sill’s executable.": {
      "comment": "状态菜单：防火墙阻止可执行文件",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 防火墙阻止了 Sill 的可执行文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The macOS firewall blocks all incoming connections, so devices on the network cannot connect. Turn off Block all incoming connections in System Settings › Network › Firewall › Options.": {
      "comment": "通用设置：防火墙阻止全部传入连接及解决方法",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 防火墙阻止了所有传入连接，因此网络上的设备无法连接。请在“系统设置 › 网络 › 防火墙 › 选项”中关闭“阻止所有传入连接”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The macOS firewall blocks all incoming connections.": {
      "comment": "状态菜单：防火墙阻止全部传入连接",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 防火墙阻止了所有传入连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The menus changed. Open the menu again.": {
      "comment": "设备菜单：菜单变化提示",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "菜单已更改。请重新打开菜单。"
