    },
    "This Mac": {
      "comment": "远程访问地址列表中的本机地址标签",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac can’t be reached while it’s asleep. While a device is connected from away, Sill keeps it from going to sleep by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 睡眠时无法连接。有设备从外部连接时，Sill 会阻止它自动进入睡眠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This build of Sill has no version number, so it can’t check.": {
      "comment": "设置更新检查：构建没有版本号",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此构建版本的 Sill 没有版本号，因此无法检查更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This code expired.": {
