    "This network. Use it with a VPN into your home network, such as WireGuard on your router.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此网络。请通过 VPN 接入家中网络后使用，例如使用路由器上的 WireGuard。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To unlock it from here, type its password and press Return. Its windows come back once it is unlocked.": {
      "comment": "已配对设备的锁屏覆盖层解锁说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要在此处解锁，请输入该 Mac 的密码并按下 Return。解锁后，其窗口就会重新出现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too long to send: %@ takes up to %lld KB of text.": {
      "comment": "剪贴板文字过长提示，插值为 Mac 名称和容量上限（KB）",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Too long to send: %1$@ takes up to %2$lld KB of text."
          }
